SLIDE 30 — PINN Inside the Optimisation Loop
Once the PINN is trained it replaces the ODE simulation as the objective function evaluator inside the optimisation loop.
The optimiser queries the PINN instead of running the full simulation. Inference takes milliseconds vs the ODE simulation. This means the optimiser can afford to explore far more of the design space in the same wall-clock time.
